{"job_id":"F-0af6c38d76edbe0fecd2","family_id":"F-0af6c38d76edbe0fecd2","title":"근로감독관증 규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006858-184050-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":9,"target_id":"f4541790a46b26a7f613825cb8a3297e57dc7f4cd615557751d4963c5c37b161","source_hash":"1c7b890caf6bc3a47a7113168df95b550bc90d250d880d54a0bbf5b1850ad1f5","text":"劳动监察员证书规则"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006858-184050-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":99,"target_id":"369c99e2db0ec712a6bf06901eb0a8f491a5768a263583cce687477d245283ba","source_hash":"588d8c17738ced7f151e78dc27f6de218f3d04e8770220db4807ad362b0360cb","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是按照《劳动监察员条例》第七条第二款的规定，规定劳动监察员证书的规格、格式、颁发等事项。劳动监察员证书是表明劳动监察员身份的识别标志。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006858-184050-ko","scope":"BODY","start":99,"end":214,"target_id":"0c9499b41f17e22599600cce7c99009ad7e951f382fdb13b2be6d2dbd3eb92fb","source_hash":"3b95a26e5b91f1e70e86c0ae5314875d46f8833b14313e28944cee9ca5e5ef2c","text":"第二条（劳动监察员证的规格、形式等）  劳动监察员证应载明签发编号、所属单位名称、个人信息，并附有照片。其规格、形式、颜色及细节应按附表规定执行。<2013年6月19日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006858-184050-ko","scope":"BODY","start":214,"end":454,"target_id":"00097223676f69f7c5b4ead8d3243f716818a6c6ddfecc607268c0d3bfbe6264","source_hash":"05a52da5ee8f0662f450844619bcf5b1eda661cff182d91e9f6b5bf816d5ebbd","text":"第三条（劳动监察员证书的签发和再签发）\n① 劳动部长签发劳动监察员证书时，应当按照附件 2 的形式在劳动监察员证书签发登记册中进行登记。\n劳动监察员身份证上的照片必须是在签发日期前六个月内拍摄的。\n③ 劳动监察员如因劳动监察员证损坏、遗失或记录信息变更而希望重新办理劳动监察员证，应当自事由发生之日起5日内，按附件3的形式向其所属机构负责人提交劳动监察员证重新办理申请。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006858-184050-ko","scope":"BODY","start":454,"end":538,"target_id":"c064d826f43c5e23e278be2d7b8dac303c7972543460fe0fefee56ad8e6bfb1d","source_hash":"8d860044fbfcb62996da5a524d4b04462196f26f162a74db621816e78bb02e81","text":"第四条（劳动监察员证书的返还）劳动监察员离职时，应当通过其所属机构负责人将劳动监察员证书返还给雇佣劳动大臣。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006858-184050-ko","scope":"BODY","start":538,"end":581,"target_id":"47afc397a8f32d29ec9422d30b1f283d3f3683ffb6bfc2550304f659991e16f4","source_hash":"395e0d10c2bd8711bf9a192d8a95444b579fca079dbe53ed4b395c590a2f37c6","text":"补充规定 <第20号，1983年6月24日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006858-184050-ko","scope":"BODY","start":581,"end":624,"target_id":"b9eca72a637e7bc8e2b976a34a7da83023156a7191d49f4a4d9378e627395815","source_hash":"8e6cf1215eab965554fd1cf13c99b0dd449f806cbf8a3ec7b87693d970e42798","text":"增补（雇佣劳动部及其附属机构组织结构实施细则）<2010年7月12日第1号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006858-184050-ko","scope":"BODY","start":624,"end":662,"target_id":"3c37de867143595b8d6b816e2cda7c485765a885095f5ecb8f52e553079110f8","source_hash":"17f62718ec8681372d471c3803ff3647ee41b5c21c983badb3168350a437f2a5","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006858-184050-ko","scope":"BODY","start":662,"end":890,"target_id":"b04977b85f6c27791b97394024f409c145753f56bbb373820167f1e7cc50ce5c","source_hash":"c2c3a132c30ad54282af3ae1e7676aa3bc0502d19c88029419c1403237a45da3","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）①至⑩ 省略\n\n  ⑪ 《劳动监察员证书规则》部分修订如下。\n\n  在第三条第一款和第三款、第四条、附表背面顶部和底部注释10的字符分类栏以及表格2中，“劳动部长”应改为“就业和劳动部长”。\n\n  在星号前后底部的第 10 号注释的文本分隔栏中，“劳动部”应分别改为“就业和劳动部”。\n\n  ⑫ 至 <36> 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006858-184050-ko","scope":"BODY","start":890,"end":932,"target_id":"a91f9b88db9297f774aca90829fc815373eb7eb2b3b1e9e6875e55645c5b0b3d","source_hash":"5ba79fb38e6840eed653fb9d38bf567ca7dc407e7fc015be1148ca16a5bf530c","text":"补充规定 <2011年12月1日第37号>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006858-184050-ko","scope":"BODY","start":932,"end":953,"target_id":"3163d4530be1aeb84e2737f5360e45a91ad30c9389a7363f2e3138d736059050","source_hash":"a47289782d995dc8a792eecb50180798b77752815995dcbf498330b6fb2fbca2","text":"补充规定 <2013年6月19日第85号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006858-184050-ko","scope":"BODY","start":953,"end":989,"target_id":"423ad28ab4c9915300efc6ed8ace7c06b72749ff12338a7031eb6660891bdf82","source_hash":"aab0022b2aaed619f242c9a8be4fce28ed02456443f36f19ac3cd36df2cda75d","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自2013年7月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006858-184050-ko","scope":"BODY","start":989,"end":1078,"target_id":"b7f1ca21708a5a9b567ae9aa266c176c02a1136f4185344105c607df39393f22","source_hash":"a2ca1fc408adcfc5c24c9468800755158289aa63de20bf6b970c3b7a0111ba35","text":"第二条（关于使用旧劳动监察员证书的过渡措施）尽管附表有修订规定，但根据旧规定颁发的劳动监察员证书仍可使用至2013年7月31日。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006858-184050-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1078,"end":2859,"target_id":"a905286fcda0e77b079c6a99a9c1bb5556287d9fac2fc98229cfc6b5429bf290","source_hash":"cfb910b7e6bb07e08ee4ce4aa0750ffbd6c8b3b4b8acaff97aa87bcfb4a39c12","text":"增补（关于批量修改法律形式的《改善建筑工人就业等法》实施细则的部分修订）<2016年6月16日第158号>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n劳动监察员证书的规格、形式、颜色和铭文（与第二条相关）\n■ 劳动监察员证书规则 [附表] <2016年6月16日修订>                                     \n\n  劳动监察员证明书的规格、形式、颜色和文字（与第二条相关）                             \n\n  1. 规格、形状和颜色                                                               \n\n    A. 规格和表格                                                                  \n\n    前 后                                      \n\n    B. 颜色和色度                                                                  \n\n  ┌───┬────────────────┐                                        \n\n  │分类 │颜色 │                                        \n\n  ├───┼────────────────┤                                        \n\n  │?    │ C 100% + M 60% / M 50% + Y 100%│                                        \n\n  ├───┼────────────────┤                                        \n\n  │❷    │ C 100% + M 20%                 │                                        \n\n  ├───┼────────────────┤                                        \n\n  │❸    │ C 15% + M 5% + Y 2%            │                                        \n\n  ├───┼────────────────┤                                        \n\n  │❹    │ K 7%                           │                                        \n\n  ├───┼────────────────┤                                        \n\n  │❺    │ K 18%                          │                                        \n\n  ├───┼────────────────┤                                        \n\n  │文本颜色│K(黑色) │                                        \n\n  └───┴────────────────┘                                        \n\n   ※ C(青色): 蓝色，M(品红色): 红色，Y(黄色): 黄色，K(黑色): 黑色      \n\n"},{"id":"A33325-zh-00001","doc":"A33325","law_id":"kr-006858-184050-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2416249","source_hash":"b1f0c2f2468df3ff55d879a0b51471dc5f7857b6a9fc6bc19a9845490f34951f","text":"■ 劳动监察员证书规则 [附表] <2016年6月16日修订>"},{"id":"A33325-zh-00002","doc":"A33325","law_id":"kr-006858-184050-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2416250","source_hash":"8afc1259cd64f541612ab9f22d4f5880330625d9984c4b231fe177648de4a841","text":"劳动监察员证书的规格、形式、颜色和铭文（与第二条有关）"},{"id":"A33325-zh-00003","doc":"A33325","law_id":"kr-006858-184050-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2416251","source_hash":"41ed7ac2347a3f5b49b16eb3aa4f9db30cc4d90dbd0ca4d0ccd4f70613bbf5d8","text":"1. 规格、形状和颜色"},{"id":"A33325-zh-00004","doc":"A33325","law_id":"kr-006858-184050-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2416252","source_hash":"3e1d48e5fe2833ba28dbc7cae52e09611dcc7892a8e84ff42dd7462c1594a88c","text":"A. 规格和表格"},{"id":"A33325-zh-00005","doc":"A33325","law_id":"kr-006858-184050-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2416253","source_hash":"f49777be462b9d1bc18d5399b6c07e477f9c5a9a066bec38405589d1ed6ed2b1","text":"正面"},{"id":"A33325-zh-00006","doc":"A33325","law_id":"kr-006858-184050-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2416254","source_hash":"4c1fa6a73a5c5f3f82982eeac85c757537d4f34317b18465277c1999e7dce3de","text":"返回"},{"id":"A33325-zh-00007","doc":"A33325","law_id":"kr-006858-184050-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2416255","source_hash":"108e11db0bfc6ba21d543bb53eaebbb86a7ef55ada53435721c1aa861ab6c5b5","text":"B. 颜色和颜色"},{"id":"A33325-zh-00008","doc":"A33325","law_id":"kr-006858-184050-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2416256","source_hash":"d8ba487317ac4e370c544ff11fee92077c5dfe235d14d8d93e213e278685f7be","text":"分类MTQ29f13724665d54a300119结束"},{"id":"A33325-zh-00009","doc":"A33325","law_id":"kr-006858-184050-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2416257","source_hash":"0b04efe6f7e90b4919d73bea65368e64dfbc9a8bbea72d260c3e99e8bc4f1997","text":"色度"},{"id":"A33325-zh-00010","doc":"A33325","law_id":"kr-006858-184050-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2416258","source_hash":"6eee16837603254b8a71d9c87b4eadcff645335d1c8146ae254eacb1b10a3307","text":"C 100% + M 60% / M 50% + Y 100%"},{"id":"A33325-zh-00011","doc":"A33325","law_id":"kr-006858-184050-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2416259","source_hash":"ead61f064dab4178e0cd9aaf571338ae04910930583855b306fb852d8af165b4","text":"C 100% + M 20%"},{"id":"A33325-zh-00012","doc":"A33325","law_id":"kr-006858-184050-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2416260","source_hash":"053d2ba70195741d87f50c44ea16678f626870cd46c8284017d2fbb886ff99b6","text":"C 15% + M 5% + Y 2%"},{"id":"A33325-zh-00013","doc":"A33325","law_id":"kr-006858-184050-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2416261","source_hash":"4e78e20a5807ea85596253fc5ee0294d1841150d7ac08836de61c1e44a60adce","text":"K 7%"},{"id":"A33325-zh-00014","doc":"A33325","law_id":"kr-006858-184050-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2416262","source_hash":"78b24aefd36d73edb9dc64f79b29bf02f3148f39f6ade3383cc7554bc592c6c5","text":"K 18%"},{"id":"A33325-zh-00015","doc":"A33325","law_id":"kr-006858-184050-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:241